# Paths an agent may merge with pr-merge-green. This file lists only what agents
# MAY merge; anything not matched here (README, docs, .github, .agents, tools,
# scripts, phase-zero, public-kit, a new top-level path) is public edge and the
# maintainer merges it. A pull request that changes any unlisted path is refused.
#
# The helper reads this file from the base branch, never from the pull request.
# This file is itself never agent-mergeable. Matching: ** crosses slashes, * and ?
# do not. One pattern per line; # starts a comment on its own line.

# Code, tests and the Markdown pages under production/ (the site builds none of them).
production/**

# One changelog fragment per pull request.
changelog.d/*.md
